para('31_ch07','The beneficiaries here are the small sites themselves.',r'''Shrinkage can reduce the influence of chance variation in small sites, but it also pulls genuinely unusual sites toward the common mean. Show the raw rate, adjusted rate, and uncertainty together, and investigate whether sites serve populations too different to justify a shared prior.''','Remove normative arithmetic fairness claim.')
